                         · 上游 `make package pkgdir=$(package_folder)` 报
                           "Directory ... already exists"（Conan 预建目录）→
                           package() 先 rmdir 解决
                         · 包内 lib/ 实测只有 libnetpbm.so.11.73（真文件）+
                           libnetpbm.so.11（soname 软链）；libnetpbm.so 与
                           libnetpbm.a 均在构建树 → test_package 报
                           "Library 'netpbm' not found in package"
                         · 补齐 libnetpbm.so 软链 + 拷入 libnetpbm.a 后
                           conan create exit=0，ctest 100% passed
authors:                ohpcd <ohpcd@localhost>
source_pr:              ""
source_commit:          ""

